# 快速诊断：检测仓库状态、manifest及核心高频服务 (ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, DeepSeek, Google Drive, Google, YouTube, Telegram, GitHub, iCloud)
generic script-path = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o-ocn/loon-rules/main/dist/diagnostics/loon-rules-diagnostic.js, tag = 规则诊断(快速), timeout = 30, argument = mode=quick

# 完整诊断：全量检测全部 14 个规则集文件、主备源镜像、以及全部已知服务连通性 (含 Grok, Muse, TestFlight, APNs安全端口)
generic script-path = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o-ocn/loon-rules/main/dist/diagnostics/loon-rules-diagnostic.js, tag = 规则诊断(完整), timeout = 60, argument = mode=full
